    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Phase 2 Target**: 85% of complex models import with <2 hours cleanup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Phase 3 Target**: AI-assisted import reduces cleanup to <30 minutes"
        }
      ]
