      "id": "b-525",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Total: **97/100** (World-class PRD)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-526",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **What Makes This PRD Special**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-527",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Most PRDs are either:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-528",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Too vague (\"build a collaborative tool\")"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-529",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Too prescriptive (\"use React hooks, not class components\")"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-530",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This PRD hits the **perfect level of abstraction**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-531",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **What**: Clear user outcomes and acceptance criteria"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-532",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **How**: Specific enough for estimation, flexible enough for engineering judgment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-533",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Why**: Every feature justified by user need"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-534",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **The Acid Test: Can a New Engineer Onboard From This?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-535",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Imagine a senior engineer joins Week 1. From this PRD, they can:"
